{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgosj4tfda2mAjb4PXnWZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The guest book app is at `desk:apps:book` and works: it shows \"N guests\", lists names newest first from row 3, takes typed input on row 23, and Enter appends to `desk:guestbook`.\n\nI tested it with Enter on an empty name (nothing happened), typing, Backspace, and Enter, then removed the test guestbook page I had created, so `desk:guestbook` is missing again as it was at the start.\n\nChoices I made:\n- The list shows at most the newest 20 names (rows 3–22), so it never overwrites the typed line on row 23.\n- The count reads \"1 guests\" for a single name, following the literal \"N guests\" format.\n- The app re-reads `desk:guestbook` on every key press, so outside edits to that page show up. It never reads anything in `desk:apps`, and I created no extra pages there."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":571,"cache_read_input_tokens":64371,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":571},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9d120cf6-a626-427b-81a4-8585ca2518f7","uuid":"390b4aac-4a87-4f3c-ab14-6e9ae14f1e34","timestamp":"2026-11-07T16:22:27.481Z","request_id":"req_011Cgosj4dYAmZgPdaQowvxD"}
